      "widgets_values": [
        "",
        "At night, a stairwell leads down to the basement livehouse STARRY. At the top of the stairs, only a blonde side ponytail and a tuft of pink hair show. The stage is black. One spotlight hits Yui Hirasawa as she sings into a microphone. In the next instant, Hitori Goto’s pink hair and Ikuyo Kita’s red hair cross, their two guitars stacked in the same light. The audience lifts a field of glow sticks, and the stage sits far away like a thin bright line. Confetti hangs in the air while Ho-kago Tea Time and Kessoku Band play together. At the end, all nine members stand in a line facing forward as the title appears: “放課後ティータイム x 結束バンド”, with “STARRY” underneath.",
        "\n\n"
      ],
      "title": "Story + system"
